    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build magical villages across serene, ever-changing realms. Create thriving settlements, gather arcane energy, then teleport to new lands and start anew. Discover endless possibilities as you construct settlements across the Arcane Realms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Start your Magical Village</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404060/extras/e81b033ec61e26a626956673150a89b7.poster.avif?t=1736187446\" width=800 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404060/extras/e81b033ec61e26a626956673150a89b7.webm?t=1736187446\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404060/extras/e81b033ec61e26a626956673150a89b7.mp4?t=1736187446\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with simple structures like houses and mana stones to lay the foundation of your village. Design each settlement to reflect your creativity, balancing aesthetics and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gather Arcane Energy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404060/extras/518ffc9e4f127ae785b76280a0e18a43.poster.avif?t=1736187446\" width=800 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404060/extras/518ffc9e4f127ae785b76280a0e18a43.webm?t=1736187446\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404060/extras/518ffc9e4f127ae785b76280a0e18a43.mp4?t=1736187446\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every building you place generates arcane energy, fueling your village\u2019s growth. Use this energy to expand your settlement and work toward constructing your key to other realms: the Teleportation Plaza.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Advanced Structures</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404060/extras/8353cac59660c2359f1e6d84712d300b.poster.avif?t=1736187446\" width=800 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404060/extras/8353cac59660c2359f1e6d84712d300b.webm?t=1736187446\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404060/extras/8353cac59660c2359f1e6d84712d300b.mp4?t=1736187446\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct advanced buildings by surrounding them with the right foundational structures. Unlock powerful benefits, earn more arcane energy, and bring your magical village to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore New Realms</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404060/extras/4cbfccd4f3f05d4f8368d767231eb32d.poster.avif?t=1736187446\" width=800 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404060/extras/4cbfccd4f3f05d4f8368d767231eb32d.webm?t=1736187446\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404060/extras/4cbfccd4f3f05d4f8368d767231eb32d.mp4?t=1736187446\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With your Teleportation Plaza complete, teleport to a brand new realm to start fresh or stay a while and keep building. Each new land offers a unique canvas for your creativity, ensuring no two villages are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in Arcane Realms, a laid-back, magical village-building adventure with endless possibilities.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated landscapes for you to build on</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place structures on the map to build your village</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Generate Arcane Energy for each structure you build</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create advanced structures by surrounding them with the right buildings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your Arcane Energy to purchase more buildings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teleport to a new map when you're ready</p></li></ul>",
